2010-08-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.","oracle_id":"5cbbb3f3-63a4-4983-81ea-8c405b10e63f","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The power and toughness of the token change as the number of creatures you control changes. The token's ability counts itself, so it'll be at least 1/1.","oracle_id":"5cbbb3f3-63a4-4983-81ea-8c405b10e63f","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players' turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated \"any time you could cast a sorcery\".","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2010-06-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The ability that defines Kalonian Twingrove's power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.","oracle_id":"cbaf8e87-da5b-4120-afec-8fe2db55b835","published_at":"2014-07-18","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The power and toughness of both Kalonian Twingrove and the token it creates will change as the number of Forests you control changes.","oracle_id":"cbaf8e87-da5b-4120-afec-8fe2db55b835","published_at":"2014-07-18","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"For Specimen Collector's last ability, the target token can be any token you control, not necessarily one of the token creatures you created due to its first ability, and not necessarily even a creature.","oracle_id":"fdb51cc1-ce0e-4920-b123-1cdd570fc38b","published_at":"2021-06-18","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
